## B1 pin fixture — user program that constructs a bootstrap-loaded
## class via its user-body `def init` and calls the user-body `get`
## accessor. If the bootstrap merge silently drops bodies (pre-B1),
## the constructor is unresolved and typeck fails.

def main()
  let b = BootstrapBodied.new(42)
  let _ = b.get()
end
